{"root_text": {"uid": "ja9", "lang": "si", "is_root": false, "title": "මඛාදෙව ජාතකය", "author": "A.P. de Zoysa", "author_short": "Zoysa", "author_uid": "zoysa", "next": {"author_uid": "zoysa", "lang": "si", "name": "One Who Lives Happily ", "uid": "ja10"}, "previous": {"author_uid": "zoysa", "lang": "si", "name": "Prince Gāmaṇi ", "uid": "ja8"}, "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta charset='UTF-8'>\n<meta name='author' content='A.P. de Zoysa'>\n<title></title>\n</head>\n<body>\n<article id='ja9' lang='si'>\n<header>\n<ul>\n<li class='division'>ඛුද්දකනිකාය</li>\n<li class='subdivision'>ජාතක</li>\n<li>(පඨමො භාගො)</li>\n<li>1. එකක නිපාතය</li>\n<li class='vagga'>1. අපණ්ණක වර්ගය</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>9. මඛාදෙව ජාතකය</h1>\n</header>\n<p><a class='ref msdiv' id='msdiv9' href='#msdiv9'>Msdiv 9</a>“මාගේ හිසෙහි හටගන්නා හෙයින් උත්තමංග රුහනම්වූ වයස් පැහැර ගන්නාවූ මේ පැසුණු කෙස් හටගත්හ. දේවදූතයෝ පහළවූහ. එහෙයින් මාගේ ප්‍රව්‍රජ්‍යාවට සුදුසු කාලය වේයයි” කීයේය.</p>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='var' id='note17' title='මඛාදෙව (bj, pts1) | දෙවදූත (mr)'>මඝදෙව</span> ජාතකං නවමං.</p>\n<footer>\n<p><span class='author'>AP de Zoysa</span> edition.</p>\n<p>Permission to publish was kindly granted by Kumari Jayawardhana.</p>\n<p>Digital files were kindly supplied by Sirisumana Godage of <a href='http://www.godage.com/'>Godage International Publishing</a>, who publish a print edition of this text.</p>\n<p>Conversion from PDF was by Janaka of <a href='http://pitaka.lk/'>http://pitaka.lk/</a>.</p>\n<p>The assistance of Amaradasa Liyanagamage, Ven Mettavihari and Maithri Panagoda is gratefully acknowledged.</p>\n<p>Prepared for SuttaCentral by <span class='editor'>Ayya Kathrin Vimalañāṇī</span>.</p>\n</footer>\n</article>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}, "translation": {"uid": "ja9", "lang": "si", "is_root": false, "title": "මඛාදෙව ජාතකය", "author": "A.P. de Zoysa", "author_short": "Zoysa", "author_uid": "zoysa", "next": {"author_uid": "zoysa", "lang": "si", "name": "One Who Lives Happily ", "ui